  "body": "With another development underway, our owner is committed to securing a sale of this delightful freestanding coastal home.\r\n\r\nThe last two-level standalone home remaining in this exclusive development, 17B is ready to be yours, with 17C and 17D already sold.\r\n\r\nEnjoy sun-filled living, beautifully framed sea views and easy-care coastal living, just a short stroll from Winston's Cove and Waiake Beach.\r\n\r\nGround-floor living is a real bonus, with a light-filled, open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flowing seamlessly outdoors. The garden offers scope to add your own creative flair, whether that means creating a lush coastal retreat or simply adding a few favourite plants and pots.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three generous bedrooms include a master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, complemented by a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n* Freestanding home on a freehold 245sqm site.\r\n* Approx. 162sqm floor area.\r\n* Ground-floor living with excellent indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n* Three generous bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms.\r\n* Beautiful sea views.\r\n* Designer kitchen with Miele appliances.\r\n* Premium Kohler and Villeroy & Boch fittings.\r\n* Central air conditioning.\r\n* Internal-access single garage plus additional off-street parking.\r\n* Garden with potential to make your own.\r\n* Zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nWith our owner focused on their next development, this is your opportunity to secure the final two-level freestanding home in a sought-after coastal setting.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to make 17B yours.\r\n\r\nFor further information and to download the property documents, visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NZK5",
